1
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:52,500
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,020
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 22=

5
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:05,400
Who is it?

6
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,440
Boss Songcai. It's you.

7
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,400
Natuo.

8
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,120
You're my only child.

9
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,480
Even now, I still remember...

10
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,200
when you were born.

11
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,200
Your neck was so tiny,

12
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,560
one squeeze and you'd be gone.

13
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,120
All these years later,

14
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,560
look how bold you've gotten.

15
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,800
You'd even turn on

16
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,000
your own father.

17
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,640
You've always been

18
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,000
completely useless.

19
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,560
Since you couldn't deal with Layla,

20
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,240
you can die in peace.

21
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,840
Dad will avenge you.

22
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:37,600
Bad news!

23
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,600
Mian's men pushed Boss off the building!

24
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,080
Ms. Layla.

25
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:48,560
Mian's arranged another marriage
for you.

26
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,880
This godfather

27
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:04,800
I've never even met

28
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,280
sure knows

29
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:11,040
how to manipulate people.

30
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,160
You're here.

31
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,640
Why are you here?

32
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,840
I asked her to come.

33
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,760
So you're Mian's adopted daughter.

34
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:45,800
That's right.

35
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:47,320
I am.

36
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,200
When I was little,

37
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,000
drug traffickers massacred my village.

38
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,560
Mian saved me.

39
00:04:00,611 --> 00:04:02,560
(Young Layla)

40
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:04,120
Then he adopted me,

41
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,480
only to make me his puppet

42
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,880
and have me do his dirty work.

43
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,680
I've never seen
what he really looks like either.

44
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,280
So now we have the same goal:

45
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,400
to find the real Mian.

46
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,800
I'm President Layla, after all.

47
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,640
Aren't you going to propose to me?

48
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,520
You think I want this?

49
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,800
It's Dad's order.

50
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,360
I can't disobey him.

51
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,880
From the day I was adopted,

52
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,400
I was nothing but

53
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,280
a gift he could give away anytime.

54
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,160
But...

55
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,440
I've had enough.

56
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:58,120
Mian has hurt a lot of other people too.

57
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,920
We can work together.

58
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,640
Then we've got one card to play.

59
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,120
The key.

60
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,320
That key gives us access to more than
Mian's money.

61
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,480
It also gives us access to
the elite's BlackGold.

62
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:10,960
BlackGold?

63
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,240
That's right.

64
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,920
For over a decade,

65
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,160
every gang in Langia

66
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,120
has paid Mian tribute

67
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,840
at a set time and place each year.

68
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,840
Mian then takes that BlackGold
and pays the elite their dividends.

69
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,000
That's why no one's been able

70
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,040
to touch Mian all these years.

71
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,000
The principal

72
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,240
belongs jointly to Mian and the elite.

73
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,760
No one can take the whole fortune.

74
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,520
No wonder he's so desperate.

75
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,440
Right.

76
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,720
This is

77
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,080
his biggest secret.

78
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,200
So...

79
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,520
is the key safe now?

80
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,200
Completely.

81
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,840
Since Mian wants us married,

82
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,760
we'll play along.

83
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,360
We'll use the key

84
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,880
to draw him out at the wedding.

85
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,400
Hudie.

86
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,440
When the time comes,

87
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,480
you hide in the shadows and wait.

88
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,400
The second Mian shows up,

89
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,440
take him out with one shot.

90
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,400
Make it clean.

91
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:08,440
Yes.

92
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,800
Langia's military commander,

93
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,800
interior minister,

94
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,280
and legislator

95
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,680
are all here, just as expected.

96
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,040
You put the word out about BlackGold.

97
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,600
Their dividends are in that account.

98
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,160
Of course they want to know

99
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,360
where the key is.

100
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,160
With his own fortune at stake,

101
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,680
Mian has no choice but to show up today.

102
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:49,600
Dad.

103
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,720
Isn't the police looking for Mian?

104
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,240
Why'd they stop?

105
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:54,920
Look.

106
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,480
Every powerful figure in Langia

107
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:58,760
is here.

108
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,160
No idea why,

109
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,800
but all these big shots

110
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,160
are protecting Zhou Yan.

111
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:08,120
The police can't do anything about it.

112
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:15,600
Zhou Yan.

113
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:19,080
If we weren't doing this
to take Dad down,

114
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,200
would you still marry me?

115
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,080
I...

116
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,040
I'm kidding.

117
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,280
Anyway,

118
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,720
it's all just an act.

119
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:36,720
Yan.

120
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:38,600
Let's drink.

121
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,360
Zhou Yan.

122
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,360
Didn't you say

123
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,400
you'd hand over the BlackGold Key?

124
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,800
What's taking so long?

125
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:58,800
Hurry up.

126
00:07:59,240 --> 00:07:59,760
What's the rush?

127
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,320
The BlackGold account is too valuable.

128
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,720
Everyone wants a piece.

129
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,960
If Mr. Mian himself won't show up,

130
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,560
how am I supposed to make the call?

131
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,720
What do you mean?

132
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,520
You're just Mian's agent.

133
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,120
We agreed.

134
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,880
No one talks about BlackGold.

135
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:15,800
No one touches it.

136
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,240
What gives you the right
to split up our money?

137
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
How did the BlackGold Key

138
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,840
end up with an outsider like you?

139
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,360
You're bluffing, aren't you?

140
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,960
The BlackGold account ends in 181013.

141
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,880
Am I right?

142
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:34,520
Mian.

143
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:37,000
Still won't show yourself?

144
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,880
Either way, I've got the key.

145
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,680
How about this?

146
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,600
I'll call it charity

147
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,120
and split what's in the account

148
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,720
among everyone here.

149
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,640
Then hand over the BlackGold Key.

150
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,240
Whoever gets it first

151
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:55,920
gets to keep it.

152
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,200
Stop!

153
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,400
Wait!

154
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,840
(Let me tell you,)

155
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:16,800
(in here,)

156
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,640
(I'm Mian, the one in charge.)

157
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,200
So...

158
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,320
it was you.

159
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,370
♪Dust rises along the border♪

160
00:09:58,370 --> 00:09:59,720
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

161
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,000
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

162
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,300
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

163
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:03,630
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

164
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:04,960
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

165
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,300
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

166
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:07,900
♪My life is mine to bear♪

167
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,590
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

168
00:10:10,590 --> 00:10:13,330
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

169
00:10:13,330 --> 00:10:15,590
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

170
00:10:15,590 --> 00:10:17,250
♪My fate is mine to command♪

171
00:10:17,250 --> 00:10:18,280
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

172
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,640
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

173
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,990
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

174
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:22,350
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

175
00:10:22,350 --> 00:10:23,640
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

176
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:24,880
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

177
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,360
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

178
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,610
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

179
00:10:27,610 --> 00:10:28,960
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

180
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,500
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

181
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:31,660
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

182
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:32,920
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

183
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:36,080
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

184
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,620
♪No more fear, no more losing my way♪

185
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:41,200
♪With blood and sweat,
I forge my glory♪

186
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,790
♪In this world of chaos,
I carve out a road to brighter days♪

187
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:46,990
♪My legend,
I'll write every chapter myself♪

188
00:10:50,950 --> 00:10:53,620
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

189
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:56,240
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

190
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,450
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

191
00:10:58,450 --> 00:11:01,640
♪My fate is mine to command,
Who dares stand in my way?♪
